Place Realtek rtw89 firmware blobs here before building the rtw89 kext bundle.
These are NOT included in the repo (licensing). Obtain from:
  linux-firmware (https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git)
  path: rtw89/

Files needed (copy all that apply to your chip):
  rtw8851b_fw.bin   — RTL8851BE
  rtw8852a_fw.bin   — RTL8852AE
  rtw8852b_fw.bin   — RTL8852BE (or rtw8852b_fw-1.bin, renamed)
  rtw8852bt_fw.bin  — RTL8852BTE
  rtw8852c_fw.bin   — RTL8852CE (or rtw8852c_fw-1.bin, renamed)
  rtw8922a_fw.bin   — RTL8922AE

The Makefile embeds them (zlib-compressed) via scripts/gen_fw_blobs.py into
src/compat/fw_blobs89.c during the rtw89 kext build (make kext89).
